  "scope_notes": "The final commit is a scripted-diff replacing cs_desc_man with m_desc_mutex. A new unit test in scriptpubkeyman_tests.cpp specifically exercises re-entrant synchronous notification behavior.",
  "changed_since_previous": "Rebased without substantive changes to the approach or architecture.",
  "card": "Converts DescriptorScriptPubKeyMan's mutex from a public RecursiveMutex to a private non-recursive Mutex (m_desc_mutex) as part of the project-wide effort to eliminate recursive mutexes (issue #19303). Public methods manage synchronization internally, shared internal routines are split into lock-held helpers, and external callers stop acquiring the lock directly. Address-availability notification callbacks are deferred until the lock is released to prevent re-entrancy deadlocks when synchronous subscribers query descriptor state. No change to RPC behavior, wallet storage, or external signer semantics is intended.",
